<title>AUSTRALIA: St George issues prospectus for US issue.</title>
<headline>St George issues prospectus for US issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>St George Bank has issued its prospectus for a US$150 million debt raising, naming Merrill Lynch and Credit Suisse First Boston as joint lead managers.</p>
<p>The subordinated notes, which will mature in 2007, form part of the US$350 million debt raising St George announced when it released its half year results last month.</p>
<p>At the time, the bank said the intended fund raising follows a reassessment of St George's target capital ratios, which are now targetted at 7.0 percent Tier 1 and 3.5 percent Tier 2.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
